      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I found a temporary fix, maybe actual solution.\n\nDownloaded a newer yt-dlp for 10.31.2024 and went into the properties of it, replaced the current VRChat one in AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat\\Tools,\n\nbefore launching VRChat, open the properties of the exe and check \"Read only\".  It keeps it on the current 10.31.2024 version and my TwitchTV links started working again, this error no longer came about.",
